# Design Token Standards

Follow `docs/design-system/final-tokens.md`.

Rules:

- Prefer existing `--b2b-*` tokens before adding arbitrary Tailwind values.
- Tailwind maps tokens; it is not the source of truth.
- Global tokens require reuse or clear semantic meaning.
- Component-specific Figma values should use component tokens like `--b2b-hero-*`.
- Do not create token names based only on raw values, such as `--b2b-18px`.
- Repeated arbitrary values must become a token, helper or component.
- Keep colors, spacing, radius, shadows, z-index, transitions and typography aligned to the Design System.
- Update `docs/design-system/final-tokens.md` when promoting tokens.
- Update `docs/design-system/README.md` when changing reusable visual rules.
- Do not silently add hardcoded visual constants to shared UI.
